### 1. Get Revenue Financial Summary & Daily Breakdown (Manager Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/reports/revenue/summary?fromDate=2026-09-14&toDate=2026-09-17&timeZoneId=Africa/Cairo
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. Get Technician Productivity & Labor Efficiency Metrics (Manager Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/reports/revenue/technicians?fromDate=2026-09-01&toDate=2026-09-14&timeZoneId=Africa/Cairo
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Filter Productivity for a Specific Technician / Labor ID (Manager Only)
@laborId = 01a08e78-f992-7637-bba5-1c9251dc9d09
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/reports/revenue/technicians?fromDate=2026-09-01&toDate=2026-09-14&laborId={{laborId}}&timeZoneId=Africa/Cairo
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get Inventory Parts Consumption Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/reports/revenue/parts-usage?fromDate=2026-09-01&toDate=2026-09-14&timeZoneId=Africa/Cairo
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Get Daily Cash Drawer Summary & Payment Channel Reconciliation (Manager Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/reports/revenue/cash-drawer?date=2026-09-15&timeZoneId=Africa/Cairo
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}